OL,3,GNEWSATwo taken to hospital after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fby ambulance following a crash in
OL,8,FCrumlin, County Antrim.
OL,10,FThe Northern Ireland Ambulance Service
OL,11,F(NIAS) received a report at about 11:30
OL,12,FBST on Sunday of a multi-vehicle crash
OL,13,Fon Poplar Road.
OL,15,FMultiple ambulance teams attended,
OL,16,Falong with the charity air ambulance.
OL,18,FAfter assessment and treatment at the
OL,19,Fscene, two people were taken to the
OL,20,FRoyal Victoria Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
